/* The Options pages (ui.h), in the style of the game's own menus: a title
 * at the top left, white labels (option values in orange), the copper
 * highlight bar behind the chosen label, and a legend box at the bottom.
 *
 * They replace the game's Options screen (opened from the title menu) and
 * open anywhere with F1. Pages: Options, Gameplay (difficulty), Video
 * (resolution, dithering, menu sides, the HUD's map), Audio (volumes),
 * Controls (each player's button layout), Vanilla Plus (every change of
 * src/vplus, by category); Mods is listed but not made yet. From the title
 * menu, Movies opens the game's History screen for now.
 *
 * Everything is laid out on the game's 640x480 screen, scaled to the window
 * height and centered; on wider windows the sides show the menu_sides
 * setting ([video]): the glass continued (extension), a blurred copy, or
 * black. The page is composed on the CPU at the window's size and shown
 * through PSY-Z's 24-bit display (Psyz_VideoSetDisplayRGB24, with patch 05
 * filling the window). While a page is open the game does not run. */
